      "id": "msft-segments",
      "type": "narrative",
      "answer": "In its latest 10-K (fiscal year 2026), Microsoft reports three segments: Productivity and Business Processes, Intelligent Cloud, and More Personal Computing. Productivity and Business Processes covers Microsoft 365 Commercial and Consumer, LinkedIn, and related products and services. The excerpts I retrieved don't describe the other two segments' contents.",
